{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "act51side_level_act51side_06_end",
  "groupId": "act51side",
  "stageId": "act51side_06",
  "title": "各自流亡",
  "storyCode": "PA-6",
  "avgTag": "行动后",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act51side/level_act51side_06_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "31ecc0de409b833be12b228502eb5085593bff2011b4431b9e918b018d97f97e",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g6_blockcamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅！我今天在化工厂翻了一天，就找到这么一箱啤酒，你还要喝啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去去去——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，你就让他喝吧，这几天他可被吓坏了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还不是，扛过来了，嗝......反正这点啤酒，也不算什么，我平时还瞧不上呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸，这位老爷，怎么沦落到这个地步了，还要找我这种“草民”借酒喝？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你是好人，最好的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅，我也是“草民”，快夸夸我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那还是算了——嗝！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......怎么突然扯到这个话题了，怪不好意思的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "听着，亲爱的朋友们，我在这里每喝一杯，出去就多还你们一箱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅、米科拉，还有费佳，人人都有份！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅，你还好吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这么能喝哪像有事的样子......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "喂，你现在就可以把剩下的啤酒留给我们，费佳就坐在你身后呢！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今晚，今晚不行，以后随便你们——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你为什么不和其他人坐在一起？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你呢？大英雄，俘虏了一个胆小的敌人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅和安托沙审了快一天，我想很快就有结果了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "希望能早点终结格罗莫夫的暴行......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你看着并不高兴？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，我一直在想，封锁区内的无线电静默到底是什么原因造成的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是第三局的强项，他们有很多手段可以做到。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可你的设备依然能接收到我的信号，为什么......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的问题太多了，“伯塔尼”......哼，这个“书呆子”的代号真没起错。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "像你这么较真的乌萨斯人越来越少，我竟然有点怀念过去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道你有秘密，费佳。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你不想说的话，我会假装那些都不存在。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想说的是，如果没有你，我不可能把帕夫洛男爵带回来......在这件事上，你才是我们的英雄。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "或许有一天，你会成为更多人的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘿，费佳、伯塔尼！过来喝两杯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅他，喝醉之后力气真大，刚才死活不让我碰酒。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在他好像终于喝醉了，我不放心又补了两拳，应该暂时醒不过来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "总之，剩下的酒正好还够倒四杯，你们愿意的话，我想和你们多聊聊，交个朋友......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然，“铅笔头”，这好像是我第一次出现在你们面前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，你刚来的时候浑身都是血，大家吓了一大跳，但一听到声音我就安心了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来吧，我已经倒好酒了。费佳，这是你的那杯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬明天！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬胜利！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "自由与幸福的灵魂。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g6_blockcamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我无法接受妥协。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "除非你能给出更有效率的方案。无论你怎么拷问，他只在意自己的安全保障。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我警告过你，帕夫洛是最典型的乌萨斯贵族。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们短视、怯懦，永远幻想上级偶尔的仁慈与“点拨”，带着一副人畜无害的嘴脸，好把所有金银装进自己的衣兜。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一旦让他们得以喘息，他们会毫不犹豫地向人民挥刀，将鲜血当作送给长官的礼物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这群擅长防腐的活尸......你就闻不到他们的臭味吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们可以一直争论下去，但也可以去制定更要紧的计划。我让他吐出的情报里，包括“十六勇士”的总部地图。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那里有最足量的补给，而且他说格罗莫夫最近经常外出，这是一个绝佳的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果他活着离开，一定会出卖你的......就算离开了卡托加区，铺天盖地的警察也会去抓捕你，我们真要在法庭上相见吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......至少我们现在的目标一致，要解放这个区域，其他争议可以以后再说。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "突袭对方的老巢显然是一个艰巨的挑战，我们愿意配合你们的行动，只是我们还需要回去休整，或许——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我明白了。等大家都准备好之后，我们再一起行动，让帕夫洛带路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托沙，你觉得呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......多带点人，索尼娅，不要低估他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......索尼娅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘，伯塔尼、费佳，我们小点声，不要吵醒他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是......想来火堆边休息一会儿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们给这里的人帮了大忙，但是我有点不知道，我能不能带领好大家，不辜负你们的努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "回到乌萨斯的时候，我也想过要在家乡过上正常的生活。然而不只是我，跟随我的人们，至今都还在这片泥泞里挣扎......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你们不知道，我其实辜负过许多人的期盼，看着同龄的朋友死在我的面前......不久后，我又要带着大家出发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我们能回到正常的生活吗？或许我还是什么都做不到......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可我觉得，你不是做到了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......嗯？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，给你半杯，我的酒还没动过呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凛冬怔在原地，不自觉地接过酒杯，嗅着浅浅的小麦香气，耳畔传来轻轻的鼾声。\n她的目光拂过每张平和的睡脸，他们的脸颊都红扑扑的，在梦中咂着嘴......这是进入封锁区后，最安静的一个夜晚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有半杯，哪怕只剩半杯......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_ltroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大，不要冲动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说！巴普洛维奇在哪？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到底是什么*乌萨斯粗口*拉走了老子的大炮！为什么要减少补给！谁来给老子解释解释！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "枢密官大人很快就会回来，凡事都能商量啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他给了我们钱，而且他身边那些保镖——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*还用你说吗？*乌萨斯粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他抄起椅子砸向了角落，几声“咕咕叽叽”的叫声响起，显得那么地惊慌、脆弱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......那是什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格罗莫夫走近，掀起了盖在“箱子”上的绒布，露出一个精致的笼子与它的住客——浑身棕色、颤颤巍巍缩在一角的循兽。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "巴普洛维奇肩上那只？今天倒是没带这个小畜生出门......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，去外面等我，我一会儿出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”守卫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2167_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "等手下走后，格罗莫夫咧开了嘴，他会给那个趾高气扬的雇主一点教训。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "粗糙的双手伸进笼子，箍住了可怜的小东西的脖子，用力一拧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g9_topwall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哟，格罗莫夫！没想到会在这里遇见你，听说这两天你有事找我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......为什么要盯着我的循兽看？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "它为什么会在这里......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几天不见你都忘了？我什么时候能缺少它的陪伴呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么，羡慕了？哈哈，我就知道你也喜欢小动物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我办公室还有一只，是要和它配种的，等生了小循兽，挑一只给你好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还不感谢大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "算了，不必多礼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "相信你也不是为了它而来，到底什么事让你如此着急？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "看了看对方身边比自己块头还大的保镖们，格罗莫夫决定把脏话都咽回去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "大人，为什么要削减我的补给？以原先的装备来防御那些小毛孩都不太够用。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......还记得我当初雇佣你们，协助管理卡托加区的理由吗？你是开价最低的那个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我希望你还记得这个优良品质，格罗莫夫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那我的大炮——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别提。大炮的事，格罗莫夫，我知道了也不会告诉你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这是贵族的工作，做好你该做的！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老大！出大事了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那些、那些学生，他们找到了“荣誉室”！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*怎么可能！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“十六勇士”打手",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2166_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我刚从那边过来，再不去帮忙，索尼娅就要杀进最里面了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "枢密官大人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "分一半的安保人员给他。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安保队长",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是有任何闪失，我保证撕碎了你来喂我的循兽，听懂了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "巴普洛维奇",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2158_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滚！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g5_blockalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......外面都搞定了，开始打扫战场。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这些家伙，虽然能打，却没有一点儿组织性。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不知道冬将军那边还顺利吗，按理说她应该打进大本营深处了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“十六勇士”为了保护大本营一定会负隅顽抗，我们得尽快过去支援。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "“铅笔头”",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2178_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但愿这个格罗莫夫藏了些真正的食物，我再也不想吃罐头了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话音未落，一枚弩箭穿透了他的胸口。他的笑容僵在脸上，身子晃了晃，栽倒在同伴脚边。\n叶列梅瞪大双眼，他的前方，格罗莫夫带着十余名膀大腰圆的恶汉，正向这里冲来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快！阻止他们！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯粗口*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "给我去死，杂碎！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "叶列梅",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2176_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他拿着钢管，扑向了格罗莫夫的锤斧，在它们接触的瞬间，叶列梅就像气球一样飞了出去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅！不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "轮到你了，小虫虫。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格罗莫夫......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你害死了那么多人，你会付出代价！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "尼卡",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2183_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我死也要死在杀你的路上！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "鲜血涌上了她的喉咙，呛得她再也说不出话。\n尼卡扭着尚有知觉的脖颈，望向叶列梅的方向。视野里，同伴们正在仓促地组织防线，而格罗莫夫已如狂兽般冲了进去。\n明明从一开始，你说要去贿赂格罗莫夫，让他放我们出去，我就知道那是陷阱。\n但我为什么要陪你去呢......叶列梅？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "该死，该死，该死！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还有机会......从后面走更快，我的人一定还在里面抵抗着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只有我知道荣誉室的口令，等我打开门，把私藏的武器都发给他们，一定能反败为胜......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "前面就是门了——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g8_saferoom_h"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "冬将军！最后一个也被我搞定了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......格罗莫夫？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "沉默只有短暂的一瞬，格罗莫夫突然跃起扑向幕墙，直冲一个机械装置而去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请输入口令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*污言秽语*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口令错误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "小心！那个按钮藏着什么机关！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "马特维！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "弩箭击中格罗莫夫的左臂，他一声怒吼，挥舞着锤斧勉强挡下众人的攻击。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "请输入口令。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*污言秽语*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口令错误。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "*乌萨斯式咆哮*！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "口令正确。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欢迎您，格罗莫夫勇士，伊戈尔大帝身边十六位骁勇无双的战士的后裔......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "坚不可摧意志的拥有者，以及无坚不摧的传奇锤斧的继承者......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "机械盒子里的录音还没播放完，格罗莫夫就已经撞开幕墙，借着势头翻滚进去。\n烈夏的挥击落空，却正好砸碎了那个恼人的盒子。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "机械识别装置",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "滋滋......十六勇士......引领......下个乌萨斯时代！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "就你，也配？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格罗莫夫刚想伸手去触碰什么，一支弩箭便钉入了他手指前一寸的墙面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，我认得你，还有你......无缚者们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "他往后一翻，拍动了某块墙砖，两面透明的“墙壁”便开始急速落下，横亘在格罗莫夫与众人之间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这原本是我为了对付巴普洛维奇而精心设计的“囚牢”，没想到第一个被关进来的人居然是我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "蠢货，你以为一道玻璃就能——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凛冬一拳砸向玻璃，却反被震得后退了几步。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这玻璃有古怪！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "第三局最新研制的材料，连皇帝陛下都没见过的新鲜玩意......我一直在想，他们研制这种材料，到底是为了囚禁谁呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "想要破开它，恐怕你们得去找一艘陆行舰来......哈哈哈！"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "格罗莫夫大口喘着粗气，毫不讲究地坐在地上，甚至有闲心给自己绑起松散的鞋带。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们的时间不多了......他们肯定有增援，外面拖不了太久。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一定还有办法！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“十六勇士”......等等！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为什么这房间里，会有两柄一模一样的锤斧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "传说中随伊戈尔大帝征战的十六名将领曾是当时最为勇猛的战士......\n冒领了他们名头的街头混混们按照传说中的样式铸造了传奇的锤斧，却发现自己的力气根本不足以举起这份荣耀。\n因而格罗莫夫将“真品”放置起来瞻仰，却挥舞着一柄仿制品。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "少做梦了，那玩意根本不可能有人挥舞得起来！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我劝你别伤着自己！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅，需要帮忙吗——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "伯塔尼目瞪口呆地看着索尼娅打碎了展示柜，举起了那柄锤斧——她隐约听见索尼娅的骨骼发出不堪重负的声响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "凛冬拖着锤斧，朝着那面无法打破的透明玻璃墙，一步一步走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g8_saferoom_e"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不......不不不不。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看起来，似乎，我比你更有资格......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对吗？！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为你杀死的人，为你纵容的恶，为你逃脱的罪与罚......为你惹恼了我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "格罗莫夫，你的遗言呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "格罗莫夫",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2161_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你，你凭什么能举起它——"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "话音刚落，锤斧重重砸下，在它短暂的下落过程中，凛冬似乎觉得这柄锤斧越来越轻。\n它不再是什么传说中的武器，也不是该被放进博物馆的文物，更不是什么杀人犯的收藏，它只是——\n力量。\n用来反抗，用来砸碎阻碍，用来劈开一条生路的力量本身。\n它没有立场，没有主张，没有路线也没有情绪。\n它就是生命最原始的怒号，是心脏每一次跳动时泵出的第一滴血，它无关这片大地上其他复杂的一切，它只在于——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "战斗！！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g4_blockst"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2177_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们得救了......索尼娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "疲惫的学生",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2177_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你把格罗莫夫的遗物送出来，大家展示后，那些混混都逃向城墙上边了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "辛苦了......我知道你们每个人，都打得很勇敢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清点完人数，把这里能带的物资尽量带走，还有牺牲的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕夫洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2174_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅！索尼娅！看这里！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕夫洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2174_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "管管你的人！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "她管不了我，没有人可以。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你的死，会让乌萨斯变得更好，男爵大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "帕夫洛",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2174_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在说什么——救命！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "烈夏",
      "speakerId": "avg_194_leto_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托沙，冷静一点！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这是交易，安托沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他吐出了位置，我们留他一条命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "索尼娅，我早就告诉过你，我不会让任何一只吸血鬼在我面前活着。他们的利用价值，最多能换来几小时的寿命。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这种人不去死，死的就会是我们的朋友、矿井下的工人、荒地上的农民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到了死亡的那一刻，他可悲的一生会献出最后的价值，赎尽自己的罪恶。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，你错了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他活着出去才会有价值。所有像他这样的投机者，都会知道我们是可以谈话、商量的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帝国的内部从来不是铁板一块，只有这样才能搅乱他们，利用他们之间的矛盾，尽可能高效地达成目的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......而我的目的，是一个没有压迫的乌萨斯，乃至一片没有压迫的大地。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我向这片大地的未来承诺过，我会亲手敲碎它的脊梁，然后在废墟上等待新的黎明。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀死这些寄生虫，不是为了复仇，索尼娅。是为了让这栋即将倒塌的危房，塌得更干净些。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杀一个已经被剥夺了一切，像循兽一样求饶的“前贵族”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你相信这样的死亡也是有意义的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我能确定的是，在这个国家，富人的自由建立在穷人的尸骨上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每扫除掉一个，就是救下了一个。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你只是想去毁灭，却不明白毁灭只能是一种手段。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "废墟是不够的，我们需要团结，需要人，一切愿意在危难之际站出来，站在我们这边，愿意为反抗不公而战的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......反抗不公？让这种人活着，就是对受他盘剥的人最大的不公。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "到此为止吧，索尼娅，这是伯塔尼抓住的人，我尊重你处置他的权力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过，既然你愿意保下这种人，无缚者将不再与你们合作，我们会独自行动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托沙，不要意气用事！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "凛冬",
      "speakerId": "avg_1051_headb2_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的所作所为，一直是在驱逐潜在的盟友，削减成功概率，削减那些视你为领袖的人存活的概率！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无缚者同盟没有领袖，我只是一名顾问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "每一个人都是自愿集结于此，要在乌萨斯所有被压迫的角落展开行动，帮助受苦的人反抗贵族的暴行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果有人不同意我的想法，任何人都可以走，任何人也都可以开除我。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "安托沙别过了脸，寻找马特维的目光。\n从他们离开学校的第一天起，他就保持着这个习惯，无论是演讲、行走还是杀人。\n马特维总会在背后默默向他投来一道支持的目光，他凭此确认自己的清醒，也凭此确认自己仍走在正确的路上。\n连乌克西克都知道，“当安托沙犯错的时候，马特维肯定会开口告诉他”。\n但此刻——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "那里并没有人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g5_blockalley"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在这里，马特维。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马特维站在雪地里，夹起一根沾血的香烟，深深吸了一口，却被呛得咳嗽起来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我不知道你还会吸烟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道你杀人只是为了杀人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们有的人，或许确实是尚未被判刑的罪犯，但他们不是注定被诛杀的怪物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你对他们宣泄了暴力，却让他们逃离了审判......你的理想中没有法律和秩序的位置。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......类似的话，你跟我说了无数次。但为普通人伸张正义，没有更好的手段了。除非你——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，安托沙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是贵族，也是乌萨斯人。每次我看到你杀人的时候，总会下意识地想，他们会不会也是像你一样的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "马特维",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2160_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但你从没给过别人，你自己拥有的机会。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "马特维说完，将那根已经点燃的香烟插回雪地里，与其他散落的、被揉碎的、被雪浸湿的香烟摆在一起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "然后，他便转身，朝着来时的路走去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我没有杀帕夫洛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "可是马特维已经走远了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "安托沙......你和马特维吵架了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没有，别乱问。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那......我晚上可以去找罗莎琳吗？她之前答应过我，打赢格罗莫夫后就给我讲她在谢拉格的故事......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，别去那里了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "明天也不行，乌克西克。以后都不要再去了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "乌克西克",
      "speakerId": "avg_4224_turdus_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可是，我们不是还要一起战斗，一起推倒那堵城墙吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但是索尼娅有他们的路，我们也有自己的路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们会证明，哪一条才是正确的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "安托沙",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2157_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无论付出什么代价。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g6_blockcamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "费佳，你在做什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清点人数。准备明天的食物。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "清点......今天，我们失去了多少人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "几名，或许是十几名。有的人还在等待治疗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我得意过，自己终于做了一件正确无比的事......但是结果却——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一切似乎没有变得更好，许多朋友的离去，和安托沙他们的决裂......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "告诉我，费佳，我有没有像来自远北的那个声音一样，让这片大地上的人们变得更好——哪怕只有一点？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是说那个被通缉的非法广播罪犯吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有的。你做对了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我想，你并不需要我来评判你做的事。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "费奥多尔点燃了熄灭许久的营火。\n他从灰堆中刨出一个被冷落的土豆，穿在木棍上，开始烤制。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因为我说什么并不重要。你如何看待自己......更为关键。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这算是一种说教吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我不知道......也许你是对的。不，也许，我是对的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那天晚上，我们也曾这样坐在火堆边，烤着土豆。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时你终于肯坐进学生们中间，与他们谈天说地，抨击时政，讨论文学......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看着你们，原本通过音频才能接触到的人，第一次出现在眼前。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这真的很好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......你的努力，从来没有白费。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，我以前是那个耳机里的声音，以后也会是那个耳机里的声音......我会一直这样下去。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "伯塔尼",
      "speakerId": "avg_4223_botany_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢谢你，费佳！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "欸？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“那天晚上，我们也曾这样坐在火堆边，烤着土豆”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“铅笔头”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "叶列梅......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "尼卡......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“小个子”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "敬你们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "费奥多尔的双手不住地颤抖。这双将金币交给“小个子”的手......\n这双救过人性命的手......\n这双曾造成无数死亡的手......\n费奥多尔说不清自己此刻的感受。他感受到自己的激动，也感受到由衷的恐惧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "72_g6_blockcamp"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "当费奥多尔回过神时，火堆只剩最后一点火苗，在黑夜中颤动着。\n手中的土豆一面烤焦了，另一面一点儿也没熟。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“还有明天”......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "费奥多尔",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_2155_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "多么简单的祷告词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "avg_1502_crosly_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
